  "container": "<div class=\"two-columns-left\" id=\"container\">\n<main class=\"main\" id=\"main\" role=\"main\">\n<article class=\"post-1639 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-resource tag-infographic tag-racial-disparities tag-summer tag-youth-physical-activity\" id=\"post-1639\" itemprop=\"mainEntity\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"schema-image\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"article-inner\">\n<header>\n<div class=\"entry-meta beforetitle-meta\">\n</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n<h1 class=\"entry-title singular-title\" itemprop=\"headline\">Infographic: Youth Physical Activity in Summer Patterns and Disparities</h1>\n<div class=\"entry-meta aftertitle-meta\">\n<span class=\"author vcard\" itemprop=\"author\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n<i class=\"icon-author icon-metas\" title=\"Author\"></i>\n<a class=\"url fn n\" href=\"/author/tylerprochnow/\" itemprop=\"url\" rel=\"author\" title=\"View all posts by Tyler Prochnow\">\n<em itemprop=\"name\">Tyler Prochnow</em>\n</a>\n</span>\n<span class=\"onDate date\">\n<i class=\"icon-date icon-metas\" title=\"Date\"></i>\n<time class=\"published\" datetime=\"2020-06-02T23:14:09-04:00\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">\n\t\t\t\t\tJune 2, 2020\t\t\t\t</time>\n<time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2020-06-02T23:14:11-04:00\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">June 2, 2020</time>\n</span>\n<span class=\"bl_categ\">\n<i class=\"icon-category icon-metas\" title=\"Categories\"></i> <a href=\"/category/resource/\" rel=\"category tag\">Resource</a></span> </div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n</header>\n<div class=\"entry-content\" itemprop=\"articleBody\">\n\n<p>Adolescents have lower levels of physical activity (PA) and more rapid weight gain during summertime when they are not attending school. African American and Latino youth gain more weight in the summer than do youth from other racial or ethnic groups. Given disparities in summer weight gain, it is important to understand PA patterns, opportunities, and barriers for the major race/ethnic subgroups to inform possible solutions tailored to these subgroups.</p>\n<p>Download our lay summaries on <a href=\"/are-adolescents-less-physically-active-in-the-summer/\">\u201cAre adolescents less physically active in the summer?\u201d</a>  as well as <a href=\"/recommended-actions-to-increase-physical-activity-of-diverse-and-disadvantaged-adolescents-in-the-summer/\">\u201cRecommended actions to increase physical activity of diverse and disadvantaged adolescents in the summer\u201d</a> to find out more about this study!</p>\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Share with your community</h5>\n<p>This infographic highlights how communities might help teens to be more active in the summer.</p>\n<p>We encourage you to download and share the infographic with your community partners and networks.</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/infographic.jpeg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1612\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"902\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/infographic.jpeg\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/infographic.jpeg 1600w, /wp-content/uploads/2020/04/infographic-300x169.jpeg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2020/04/infographic-1024x577.jpeg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2020/04/infographic-768x433.jpeg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2020/04/infographic-1536x866.jpeg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2020/04/infographic-532x300.jpeg 532w\" width=\"1600\"/></a><figcaption>Infographic</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/PARC-UCSD-Video-two-logos-1-1.gif\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1615\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/PARC-UCSD-Video-two-logos-1-1.gif\" width=\"1600\"/></a><figcaption>GIF Animation</figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n </div><!-- .entry-content -->\n<footer class=\"entry-meta entry-utility\">\n</footer><!-- .entry-utility -->\n</div><!-- .article-inner -->\n<span class=\"schema-publisher\" itemprop=\"publisher\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Organization\">\n<span itemprop=\"logo\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n<meta content=\"/\" itemprop=\"url\"/>\n</span>\n<meta content=\"Physical Activity Research Center\" itemprop=\"name\"/>\n</span>\n<link href=\"/infographic-youth-physical-activity-in-summer-patterns-and-disparities/\" itemprop=\"mainEntityOfPage\"/> </article><!-- #post-## -->\n<nav class=\"navigation\" id=\"nav-below\" role=\"navigation\">\n<div class=\"nav-previous\"><em>Previous Post</em><a href=\"/official-parc-introduction-video/\" rel=\"prev\"><span>Official PARC Introduction Video</span></a></div>\n<div class=\"nav-next\"><em>Next Post</em><a href=\"/infographic-physical-activity-and-recreation-in-children-in-communities-of-color/\" rel=\"next\"><span>Infographic: Physical Activity and Recreation in Children in Communities of Color</span></a></div>\n</nav><!-- #nav-below -->\n<section id=\"comments\">\n</section><!-- #comments -->\n</main><!-- #main -->\n<aside class=\"widget-area sidey\" id=\"primary\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/WPSideBar\" role=\"complementary\">\n<section class=\"widget-container widget_search\" id=\"search-2\">\n<form action=\"/\" class=\"searchform\" method=\"get\" role=\"search\">\n<label>\n<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search for:</span>\n<input class=\"s\" name=\"s\" placeholder=\"Search\" type=\"search\" value=\"\"/>\n</label>\n<button class=\"searchsubmit\" type=\"submit\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Search</span><i class=\"icon-search\"></i></button>\n</form>\n</section>\n<section class=\"widget-container widget_recent_entries\" id=\"recent-posts-2\">\n<h3 class=\"widget-title\"><span>Recent Posts</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a href=\"/impact-of-a-youth-advocacy-policy-systems-and-environmental-change-program-for-physical-activity-